{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03240","headline":"军中人日登高赠房明府 · 宋之问","name":"军中人日登高赠房明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽郊昨夜阴风断，顿觉朝来阳吹暖。\n泾水桥南柳欲黄，杜陵城北花应满。\n长安昨夜寄春衣，短翮登兹一望归。\n闻道凯旋乘骑入，看君走马见芳菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}